eka moment where he apparently  came up with a way to defeat Kath and  half jokingly in that video I said that  Arthur might be planning to have some  cat casserole basically I said that  instead of cath eating Arthur Arthur  could just eat cat  this would allow him to defeat the  monster and get the stolen fragment of  chaos  back inside of him at the same time and  it turns out that this is exactly what  Arthur actually had in mind as katha tax  yet again attempting to consume Arthur  and everyone else in sight  Arthur turns the tables on the monster  Arthur uses the power of chaos to turn  everything around them into a giant  mouth with endless fangs and as the  fangs descend upon cath cath tries his  best to resist Kath declares that as a  direct descendant of chaos he is the  only one fit to wield chaos power not  Arthur in the past we were told that all  the creatures from purgatory were  created by the mother of chaos so  technically that does make cath [ __ ]  a descendant of chaos since Cass is a  creature from purgatory but here's the  interesting thing  Hawke and his brother Wilde are also  creatures from purgatory so by that  logic Hawke himself is also a direct  descendant of chaos I wonder if this  will come into play at some point in the  future knowing what we know now about  the power of chaos Hawke might really  have the potential to become a lot  stronger than we could have imagined by  the end of the story Hawke strength may  become more than just a meme as caf-pow  Luke struggles to push back Arthur's  attack Arthur asks the Beast to tell him  what he hopes to accomplish with the  power of chaos if you were expecting  some deep philosophical answer sorry to  tell you that cath answers by saying  that he just wants to destroy everything  with a form he just wants to destroy  destroy destroy everything in the world  not a very compelling villain motivation  but I guess you have to respect the  insane narrow-minded focus that cath  seems to have as a villain cath doesn't  have a tragic past he doesn't have a  master plan he doesn't have a deep  philosophy he just wants to break stuff  Merlin says that calf appears to be a  cluster of destructive will wrought by  chaos and this brief statement by Merlin  made me think of something is it  possible that chaos power or the will of  chaos actually split itself into  different creatures of purgatory  so then cath  represents the destructive will of chaos  and other creatures of purgatory like  Hawk represent something else some other  aspect of chaos perhaps there is more to  the backstory of Hawk Hawks brother wild  and Hawks mama a backstory that is  directly connected to the power of chaos  and that is yet to be fully revealed  after giving his reply Kath fires back  at Arthur asking him what he wants to  use chaos power for did Arthur actually  learn his lesson about the inevitably  fleeting nature of all things or is he  going to keep trying to build another  Kingdom even though that Kingdom will  also be destined to eventually crumble  and fall like all kingdoms do  Arthur reveals that he isn't concerned  about being knowledged as a great leader  by others or being loved as a king his  goal is simply for everyone to live  happily the message that Arthur wants to  get across is this it doesn't matter  what others think of you but what you  think of others this is actually a  pretty profound piece of philosophy  right here so many of us spend way too  much time worrying about what others  think of us do other people like us do  they hate us do they talk behind our  backs and so on most of the time we have  no control over what other people think  of us and yet we allow ourselves to get  stressed out about these things anyway  but what's the point of being stressed  out and upset about something over which  you have no control no amount of  stressing out is going to change  anything so why bother concerning  yourself with the opinions of other  people the one thing that you can't  control is how you think of others are  you being too judgmental of other people  are you talking about other people  behind their back are you being rude  harsh or critical towards others for no  good reason this is the part that you  can control and figuring this out is the  key to happiness you shouldn't worry  about the things that you cannot control  don't worry about how other people act  or what they think of you that is up to  them not you what you can control is how  you act towards other people and how you  interact with them you can choose to be  a good person  and live a happy life by focusing on  those things that are within your  control and by ignoring those things  that are out of your control again I  really like this philosophy I love this  approach and I just wanted to talk about  it a bit here Arthur then declares that  he wants to establish a land where  nobody suffers and nobody grieves a safe  land where nobody will feel terrified of  anything he vows to create this  everlasting kingdom Kath mocks this idea  repeating yet again that nothing is  everlasting in this world nothing except  for chaos but in that moment Kath seems  to realize what Arthur is getting at and  meliodas Merlin seemed to realize it as  well chaos is indeed the only  everlasting thing in this world and  Arthur is the king of chaos in the next  moment Kath is sucked into the giant  mouth in the sky and absorbed into our  third the world suddenly returns to  normal and the sins an Elizabeth  realized that Kath is gone and the full  power of chaos has been returned to  Arthur Excalibur is stable once again  and under Arthur's complete control  meliodas and the sins decide to support  Arthur in his goal they tell him to go  for it to try and create the everlasting  Kingdom that he had talked about the  seven deadly sins vowed to stand with  Arthur and to support him and even if he  makes mistakes they will be right there  with him and this is how the chapter  ends but I have to say that this final  part in particular gave me very clear  sequel vibes first Arthur announces that  he has a very ambitious and borderline  impossible goal and then the sins  encourage him to pursue it and they  promise to be there to support him along  the way it is almost as if a brand new  journey is just beginning a journey  featuring Arthur as the main character  but still keeping the sins there in a  supporting role over the last few years  there has been a lot of talk about a  potential sequel or spin-off featuring  Arthur as the protagonist but most fans  of the seven deadly sins love the sins  themselves a lot more than Arthur so  many people were critical of this idea  however if  there is an Arthur sequel in which the  original sins still play a prominent  supporting role I bet most seven deadly  sins fans will still read it if the main  seven deadly sins series ends and the  Arthur sequel is the only place where we  can find meliodas bond Merlin and all  our favorites you better believe that I  will be reading it even though I  certainly don't think that Arthur is as  great a protagonist as say meliodas bond  or Eskin or it is important to remember  that the sound that lee sin's manga has  consistently been one of the top 10  selling manga in Japan and the franchise  including the manga anime and video  games has made a ton of money while it  is possible then the entire series could  really end for good if that happens in  the next few chapters there is no way  that we will get a satisfying ending at  the same time if there is some type of  continuation including a potential  sequel featuring Arthur then a lot more  money can still be made from this  franchise and that is why I think that a  continuation is definitely possible in  the manga industry like in pretty much  every other industry money talks and if  the seven deadly sins is extremely  profitable it wouldn't be surprising if  the creator and the publisher continued  to find new ways to profit from it the  end of chapter 3 4 3 definitely seemed  like the setup for a new adventure and a  potential story continuation to me and  at the very end after the sins said that  they would stand with Arthur Arthur  states that the sins are his everlasting  goal this might mean that Arthur simply  admires the sins and their friendship  but it could also mean that Arthur's  everlasting goal was to become one of  the seven deadly sins with esken organ  rest in peace Big Daddy sunshine there  is now an open spot for Arthur to become  the new 7th cent I know that compared to  esken or Arthur is nowhere near as epic  and there is no way that Arthur can ever  fill esken or shoes as a character but I  wonder whether Arthur could potentially  join the sins as an official member and  that can be the starting point for a  brand new continuation to the story  please let me know what you guys think  will Arthur become the new 7th sin and  will there be some sort of continuation  of the seven deadly sins story after  this main story finishes its run  and of course here on the channel I will  continue to follow the seven deadly sins  series and I will keep you posted on  whether the series really will end and  whether there will be a sequel or a  spin-off of any kind if you enjoyed this  video and you want to see more please  leave a like to let me know and if  you're new to animal parole or you just  haven't subscribed yet please subscribe  and hit that notification bell to turn  on all notifications if you don't go  through the trouble of clicking the bell  and selecting the option that says all  YouTube is gonna bury a lot of our  videos that's just the way it goes I  want to give a big thank you to all of  our anime out pro patrons for supporting  our work and making these videos  possible with all the constant problems  on YouTube patron support is more  important than ever thank you guys so  much  first and foremost a special thank you  to our the one tier patrons the ones who  rise above all other clans including in  grata alone Adam the world stealers the  school bus  Tyson Kadena a quite respect and part a  heffa and I can't forget our pro hero  tier patrons including the one and only  Gilgamesh nothing but a fan Jason Wilson  Kings eldred's fitted ala beat alpha do  Anatoli Cassatt's key on hell Cruz team  Sparky 65 cricket XP of Rohan Kapoor  Jessica Maloney Emperor otaku Timothy  Eve Argus Sean tart Joe Stanton JCCC  waka very Gucci and Jessica Kayla Fong  if you enjoy our videos and you think  that they provide value for you consider  supporting us on patreon even a single  dollar will give you access to our  patron exclusive discord and your name  will appear in our videos along with  these legendary people as always thank  you guys so much for watching and until  next time see us bass cowboys  [Music]
 

